`limite_mlx.py` is an MLX port of the `limite` architecture. It is derived from
the reference implementation in the vLLM plugin published by Paradigma at
https://github.com/paradigma-inc/limite-violetto, which is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. `tests/reference_torch.py` is a PyTorch
implementation of the same architecture, used to verify the port.

The model weights (paradigma-inc/limite-1b-violetto, limite-1b-base,
limite-1b-base-soup) are published separately by Paradigma under the Apache
License, Version 2.0, and are not redistributed here.

The architecture combines published research:
  * Exclusive Self Attention (XSA), arXiv:2603.09078
  * Multiway Dynamic Dense connections (MUDD), arXiv:2502.12170
